  "title": "Vesta Freight Drives 18x Shipment Growth with Descartes’ Transportation Management Solution Suite",
  "summary": "ATLANTA, Georgia, February 17, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Descartes Systems Group (Nasdaq:DSGX) (TSX:DSG), the global leader in uniting logistics-intensive businesses in commerce, announced that Tennessee-based third-party logistics (3PL) provider Vesta Freight is using Descartes transportation management suite to transform its nationwide freight operations and drive 18x growth in monthly shipment volume.",
